FACT firstfruits_ebal_curses.the_people_this_day(moses_and_the_priests_the_levites_be_silent_and_hear) = ("Moses and the priests the Levites: be silent and hear (27:9) — the second frame, the line's speaker; 'attend and hear' (Onkelos); no shelf row — the misprint excluded (hear_o_israel's hear, O Israel (6:4) — the creed's call: Jacob's sons' answer the first saying (Pesachim 56a); the four seats all this book's by CALL): THE LINE people_this_day_declared at the counter's day, no marker; the Levite who speaks with Moses accepted", ['became_the_lords_people_this_day', 'hearken_and_do_commanded'], [('INK', "Deut 27:9 — 'AND MOSES AND THE PRIESTS THE LEVITES SPOKE TO ALL ISRAEL saying: BE SILENT AND HEAR, O ISRAEL' — the second frame ('saying' the second of three); 'be silent' once in the Bible; 'hear, O Israel' the creed's call (6:4's four seats — hear_o_israel's cell)"), ('MOVE', "Onkelos 27:9 — 'ATTEND and hear'; the Sifrei 291:6-7 read whole and EXCLUDED at the reading (the English's 'Dt.27:9' the translator's misprint for 25:9 — the shoe's words); cold_run_hear_o_israel (CALL) — HI.the_creed(hear_o_israel) = hear, O Israel (6:4) — the creed's call: Jacob's sons' answer the first saying (Pesachim 56a); the four seats all this book's (the call's four seats, all this book's) — the priests the Levites speak with Moses — the frame the line's speaker; no shelf row on the verse; the readback row 27:9 VARIANT against the creed's call and the offer at Sinai"), ('DATA', "THE LINE people_this_day_declared at the counter's day (40, 11, 1), STATUTE by form, no marker — its subject 'moses and the priests the levites (to israel)'; the readback row 27:9 SUPPLIED with the line's two writes; the exam's person the Levite who speaks with Moses — accepted")])
