FACT firstfruits_ebal_curses.the_people_this_day(hearken_to_his_voice_and_do_his_commandments) = ("hearken to His voice and do His commandments (27:10) — the condition 28:1 tests; 'receive the Memra' (Onkelos); 5:1's four verbs the kin (covenant_at_horeb's hear, learn, keep, do (5:1) — the second speech opened: Moses' call to all Israel, the four verbs in order; the frame's second seat, no write and release_firstborn's the hearkening (15:5) — 'only if you diligently hearken': 28:1's header fourteen of seventeen in order, 11:13's conditional the same form (BC.the_second_paragraph by CALL): blessings_for_hearing REUSED — a second entry on Israel at the chapter's own day (7:12's the first); the one who hearkens diligently accepted by CALL): THE WRITE hearken_and_do_commanded, a STATUS on Israel at the chapters' own day", ['hearken_and_do_commanded'], [('INK', "Deut 27:10 — 'AND YOU SHALL HEARKEN TO THE VOICE OF THE LORD YOUR GOD AND DO HIS COMMANDMENTS AND HIS STATUTES which I command you this day' — the condition 28:1 tests (28:1 and 28:15 sixteen in order — the state row's two arms); Onkelos 'RECEIVE THE MEMRA of the LORD' (26:14, 28:1 the same rendering)"), ('MOVE', "cold_run_covenant_at_horeb (CALL) — CH.the_assembly_called(hear_learn_keep_do) = hear, learn, keep, do (5:1) — the second speech opened: Moses' call to all Israel, the four verbs in order; the frame's second seat, no write (5:1's four verbs); cold_run_release_firstborn (CALL) — RF.the_needy_and_the_blessing(the_hearkening) = the hearkening (15:5) — 'only if you diligently hearken': 28:1's header fourteen of seventeen in order, 11:13's conditional the same form (BC.the_second_paragraph by CALL): blessings_for_hearing REUSED — a second entry on Israel at the chapter's own day (7:12's the first); the one who hearkens diligently accepted (15:5's hearkening, 28:1's header fourteen of seventeen) — hearken and do — the two verbs of the frame's close; 'receive the Memra' Onkelos's rendering of hearkening at 26: