FACT festivals_judges.the_feast_of_booths(the_gathering) = ("the gathering (16:13) — the floor and the press grow on the past year's water, vegetables not (the Sifrei 140:6): the one who tithes vegetables by their picking accepted", ['accepted'], [('INK', 'Deut 16:13 — "THE FEAST OF BOOTHS you shall keep seven days, when you gather in from your threshing floor and your winepress" — "the feast of booths" spelled defective here alone in the Bible [\'Deut 16:13\']; "seven days" [\'Deut 16:13\']'), ('MOVE', "the Sifrei 140:6-7 (read whole at the reading) — THE GATHERING — as the floor and the press are particular in growing on the past year's water, vegetables went out, which do not (140:6 — R. Yose the Galilean): the vegetables' tithe year from the feast's gathering clause (Mishnah Rosh Hashanah 1:1, Sheviit 2 owed): a DATA row"), ('DATA', "the gathering a DATA row (the_vegetables_tithe_year); the exam's person the one who tithes vegetables by the year of their picking — accepted")])
